messages "Gynter**Subj: pahDate: Oct 14Necromancer---------------------------------------------------------The Necromancers are the masters in the dark artsof animating dead flesh.They are cast aside by the other spellcasting guildsbecause the kind of art they indulge themself in.And the necromancers find themself in this becausethey can only feel disgust for these lesser patheticspellcasters who doesn't have a thread of evil in them.They have evolved the powers of death to the extentthat not only can they animate dead flesh, they canalso command it to do their biddings.And as a relflection of the darkness in their artsand souls, they use their undeads as mindlessfighting goons to help them in their filthy causes.Their primary stats are intelligence and wisdom.This guild is NOT recommended for beginners!**"
